  "prefLabel": "Bar 404.02 Initial License Inspection Passage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 404.02 Initial License Inspection Passage. A school or shop initial license, including initial licenses required due to relocation, shall be issued upon compliance with Bar 404.01 and completion of an inspection showing compliance with all applicable items on the inspection report.\n\nSource. #5308, eff 1-16-92; ss by #6046-b, eff 6-1-95; ss by #6230, eff 4-26-96; ss and moved by #6577, eff 9-13-97 (formerly Bar 501.02); ss by #7323, eff 7-26-00; ss by #7555, eff 9-12-01; ss by #9345, eff 12-10-08; ss by #12226, eff 6-30-17",
